 "offset_seconds": -2.720000000000198,
 "words_heard": 255,
 "words": 264,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Jacob had twelve sons, but one he loved the best",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The son of his old age, set apart from all the rest",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He made a richly ornamented robe for him to wear",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And his brothers couldn't speak a kind word to him there",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Out in the fields of Dothan they saw him coming on",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Here comes that dreamer, let us kill him and be done",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Reuben said don't shed his blood, just throw him in the pit",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They stripped him of his robe and they dropped him down in it",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Twenty pieces of silver",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For their brother, their own flesh",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "On a caravan to Egypt",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With the balm and gum and myrrh",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the boy who wore the robe",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Was a slave upon the road",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They dipped the robe in goat's blood and they sent it home to say",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We found this, is it your son's, and the old man turned away",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It is my son's robe, he cried, a wild animal has torn him",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he would not be comforted, the father went on mourning",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Twenty pieces of silver",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For their brother, their own flesh",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "On a caravan to Egypt",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With the balm and gum and myrrh",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the boy who wore the robe",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Was a slave upon the road",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sold again in Egypt to Potiphar the guard",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Far from his father's tent and the fields of home so far",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the brothers did not see it and the boy did not yet know",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD was with Joseph",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Everywhere that he would go",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Twenty pieces of silver",
